      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便我这样告诉艾尼斯风神，\n她也仍旧坚持不愿放弃。\n因为她想让家人看见永不倒下的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "153a1774a985d79e0e8906566134cf1c795b34ad38c377547984c440535bdd07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
