    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e8f5a595c5f1e685fd1474",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“菊花赏”当天。\n艾尼斯风神很难得地\n在打工方面出错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e66422bd0b65db01b5946e8efb3b34e0e019d3b687c3b1276a50b7b005d9acd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031411.json",
