    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d936c4c3eb7fb6de2f58a77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跳舞就是妹妹们的梦想。\n直到“有马纪念”之前\n艾尼斯风神一直擅自这么认为。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae82eb05ec93d35ddb7d9a9a0754a4bf1e36f9252ac53562bea4ff2b1348b613",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031412.json",
      "json_path": [
