    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17568bcc17904d99dc80f48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽和目白赖恩。\n强劲对手云集的“有马纪念”，\n艾尼斯风神将带着家人和众人的梦想一起奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14675b946faadfa92d7988a15525c95729085f9a793a72a2e3befb0714c6ea96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
