    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5abbc937ac874374535880",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她也没有因此懈怠比赛准备。\n打工同伴们全力配合她，\n为了她调整排班时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "df254a76bcb2fdbd4abcdc35d08826492a0aad692ae2219006c16954e550dd2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
