    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b5cacc6796415c6f9519849",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些人说我的跑姿带来“希望”、“梦想”，\n并一直声援自己。\n想到这些人，艾尼斯风神干劲十足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b59db84e333cdd5908408911efbffdccffb5ee0abdf2f58e8a1a0203d37129f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
