      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "充满支持目白家声援声的京都赛场。\n这也是她们一路背负着期待的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb056e2c230ff073be3f623d0db7df2d925c17be8eeb45cd7e8e7544cb21ede1",
