    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2186300a719496a7c32eb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错……“回应粉丝”该怎么做？\n艾尼斯风神试着从目白家的两人身上\n学习该有的态度及坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba5e2e08a1d927a72d1ac6c16654312afcb2263f24873172ef834de55b73fdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
