    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a668f394e5bf092ecfebc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神将挑战“天皇赏（春）”，\n迎战目白赖恩和目白麦昆\n这两位强大对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7377d6072f7ff353b711ef456dc83c7a220fa36ea5f19fb1da3a301092f272d",
