    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8516c274e86aab8f807ca881",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩为了取胜所付出的努力\n是货真价实的。\n目白光明也深信她会成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a3327780bfae4a76c2be2bb2f4819861e800e915d7679633a0bb55735fd84a",
