    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c2f81eb558673d007a2cfa3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神也背负了许多人的梦想。\n她希望用胜利来回馈大家对自己的期待。\n即使对手再强大也绝不能输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b0352399460312f4c8736b1db6aa7051e25bbc6824b171ca586ab0da3cc9be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
