    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a367b5f403fae6466c4fc0cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要回应大家的声援、和大家一起实现梦想。\n艾尼斯风神的意念正熊熊燃烧。\n“宝冢纪念”也将揭开序幕──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cacfaacba930809c528397b931691b309cea8e53eb486a8043e63ca9d53b8c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
