      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神表示，\n自己是因为想跑而跑，\n我也试着让她明白“这样就够了”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2102804d33d3fb214a47b924961991987c21b79336f22020b107173fb84e968d",
