      "uid": "zhcn:66e8b18a412908cd255cc298",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丝毫不畏惧的艾尼斯风神自信地表示\n“我会是最享受比赛的人”。\n承载着众多梦想的“有马纪念”即将开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da2bac0b532515ccc0e14cb656a6666227fec0e6401ab5ef9af015357bd6fd5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
